  "summary": {
    "n_breaks": 3,
    "all_repaired": true,
    "all_localized_correctly": true,
    "note": "Each break is repaired by optimization (PE recovers the true value, resim RMSD ~0) and independently DIAGNOSED by the recall-free localization baseline (fit all candidates; the broken one is the one that must move). Break ids are opaque; the reference and broken time-courses are shown on the card. Celebrity-ness of the model no longer helps \u2014 the oracle is an optimizer, not recall."
  }
